cuss?\nA How difficult it is for participants to get to the event.\nB Technical issues with the event management systems.\nC Finding good quality food and drinks for the event.", "sourcePage": 121, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 127, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 29, "prompt": "You hear a pharmacist talking to a doctor about a patient’s medication.\nWhat is the pharmacist doing?\nA reporting side effects\nB checking the dosage\nC recommending an alternative", "sourcePage": 121, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 127, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 30, "prompt": "You hear a doctor advising a patient about a change in medication.\nWhat condition is the patient being treated for?\nA hay fever.\nB drowsiness.\nC hives", "sourcePage": 121, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 127, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacd